## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- [mise](https://mise.jdx.dev) for dev tool management

### Setup

```bash
mise install --locked
```
{% if 'python' in languages %}
## Python

### Install Dependencies

```bash
mise exec -- uv sync
```

### Run Tests

```bash
mise exec -- uv run pytest
```
{% endif %}
{% if 'rust' in languages %}
## Rust

### Build

```bash
mise exec -- cargo build
```

### Run Tests

```bash
mise exec -- cargo test
```
{% endif %}
{% if 'typescript' in languages %}
## TypeScript

### Install Dependencies

```bash
